editor-color tree
editor-placeable yes
placement tile
model pine-tree
texture tree-wood
texture-node pine-trunk
render-node pine-trunk
render-node pine-crown
render-node pine-crown-vector
render-node pine-lights
collision-mode solid
movement stationary
vertical-offset 0
